<title>USA: NDC Automation Q3 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>NDC Automation Q3 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>8/31/96		    8/31/95</p>
<p> Shr   loss	$0.03	  loss    $0.23</p>
<p> Net   loss	116	    loss    930</p>
<p> Revs		1,145		    1,817</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr   loss	$0.03	  loss    $0.65</p>
<p> Net   loss	121	    loss    1,874</p>
<p> Revs		4,099		    6,064</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is NDC Automation Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said that the reduction in its net income loss in the third quarter and first nine months of fiscal 1996 was due to its restructurings of certain operations and expenses. The company also said it had personnel costs of $370,000 in the third quarter 1995 which were not incurred in the third quarter 1996.</p>
